MDL601, C1 (hypothesis), F3, F13: mydumper never passes host, user and
password of [mydumper] to GOption, and because the file also has [client], it
hands the file to the MySQL client library without a group, which then reads
only the client groups. user and password of [mydumper] are read by nobody:
the connection to the host of [client] is refused.
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/defaults.cnf --database app
lint: MDL405, MDL601
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: nonzero
expect connected: false
expect stderr-contains: Access denied
-- defaults.cnf --
[client]
host=mysql

[mydumper]
user=e2e
password=e2e-password
